","kind":"person","person_id":"1h3_vs7_t8h_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m027-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"1h3_vs7_t8h_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","book_id":"b-shiji-034","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p004","text":"樂毅留徇齊五歲，下齊七十餘城，皆為郡縣以屬燕，唯獨莒、即墨未服。會燕昭王死，子立為燕惠王。惠王自為太子時嘗不快於樂毅，及即位，齊之田單聞之，乃縱反閒於燕，曰：「齊城不下者兩城耳。然所以不早拔者，聞樂毅與燕新王有隙，欲連兵且留齊，南面而王齊。齊之所患，唯恐他將之來。」於是燕惠王固已疑樂毅，得齊反閒，乃使騎劫代將，而召樂毅。樂毅知燕惠王之不善代之，畏誅，遂西降趙。趙封樂毅於觀津，號曰望諸君。尊寵樂毅以警動於燕、齊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"燕昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"燕惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"田單","kind":"person","person_id":"9li_j1i_hm5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0101","start":101,"end":104,"surface":"燕新王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"他將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛論、群體或未定個體保留，不按相同王臣稱全域合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0135","start":135,"end":138,"surface":"燕惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"騎劫","kind":"person","person_id":"ez6_e2l_0ml","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0164","start":164,"end":167,"surface":"燕惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0183","start":183,"end":185,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m004-0197","start":197,"end":199,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","book_id":"b-shiji-080","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p005","text":"齊田單後與騎劫戰，果設詐誑燕軍，遂破騎劫於即墨下，而轉戰逐燕，北至河上，盡復得齊城，而迎襄王於莒，入于臨菑。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m005-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"齊田單","kind":"person","person_id":"9li_j1i_hm5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m005-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"騎劫","kind":"person","person_id":"ez6_e2l_0ml","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m005-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"騎劫","kind":"person","person_id":"ez6_e2l_0ml","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m005-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"1h3_vs7_t8h_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","book_id":"b-shiji-080","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:p006","text":"燕惠王後悔使騎劫代樂毅，以故破軍亡將失齊；又怨樂毅之降趙，恐趙用樂毅而乘燕之獘以伐燕。燕惠王乃使人讓樂毅，且謝之曰：「先王舉國而委將軍，將軍為燕破齊，報先王之讎，天下莫不震動，寡人豈敢一日而忘將軍之功哉！會先王棄群臣，寡人新即位，左右誤寡人。寡人之使騎劫代將軍，為將軍久暴露於外，故召將軍且休，計事。將軍過聽，以與寡人有隙，遂捐燕歸趙。將軍自為計則可矣，而亦何以報先王之所以遇將軍之意乎？」樂毅報遺燕惠王書曰：","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"燕惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"騎劫","kind":"person","person_id":"ez6_e2l_0ml","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"燕惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"先王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"先王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"寡人","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"先王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛論、群體或未定個體保留，不按相同王臣稱全域合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"寡人","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"左右","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛論、群體或未定個體保留，不按相同王臣稱全域合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"寡人","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"寡人","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"騎劫","kind":"person","person_id":"ez6_e2l_0ml","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0150","start":150,"end":152,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"寡人","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0168","start":168,"end":170,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"先王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0188","start":188,"end":190,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0195","start":195,"end":197,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-080-leyi:m006-0199","start":199,"end":202,"surface":"燕惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-080-leyi","book_id":"b-shiji-080","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-080-leyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p002","text":"頃之，燕昭王卒，惠王立，與樂毅有隙。田單聞之，乃縱反閒於燕，宣言曰：「齊王已死，城之不拔者二耳。樂毅畏誅而不敢歸，以伐齊為名，實欲連兵南面而王齊。齊人未附，故且緩攻即墨以待其事。齊人所懼，唯恐他將之來，即墨殘矣。」燕王以為然，使騎劫代樂毅。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"燕昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"田單","kind":"person","person_id":"9li_j1i_hm5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"齊人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未定角色或泛論保存；神為策略敘事，不補具名神祇或宗族親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"齊人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未定角色或泛論保存；神為策略敘事，不補具名神祇或宗族親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"他將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未定角色或泛論保存；神為策略敘事，不補具名神祇或宗族親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"燕王","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"騎劫","kind":"person","person_id":"ez6_e2l_0ml","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m002-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"gz0_xuu_ont","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan","book_id":"b-shiji-082","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-082-tiandan"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p005","text":"田單乃收城中得千餘牛，為絳繒衣，畫以五彩龍文，束兵刃於其角，而灌脂束葦於尾，燒其端。鑿城數十穴，夜縱牛，壯士五千人隨其後。牛尾熱，怒而奔燕軍，燕軍夜大驚。牛尾炬火光明炫燿，燕軍視之皆龍文，所觸盡死傷。五千人因銜枚擊之，而城中鼓譟從之，老弱皆擊銅器為聲，聲動天地。燕軍大駭，敗走。齊人遂夷殺其將騎劫。燕軍擾亂奔走，齊人追亡逐北，所過城邑皆畔燕而歸田單，兵日益多，乘勝，燕日敗亡，卒至河上，而齊七十餘城皆復為齊。乃迎襄王於莒，入臨菑而聽政。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"田單","kind":"person","person_id":"9li_j1i_hm5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m005-0052","start":52,"end":57,"surface":"壯士五